{"attack":"在攻击之后急速返回，和后备宝可梦进行替换。","description":"攻击目标造成伤害。\n伏特替换使用成功时，使用者与后备宝可梦替换，除非使用者是同行宝可梦中唯一没有陷入濒死状态的宝可梦。\n若当回合使用者被追打定为目标，且使用者先行动，则退场前会受到翻倍威力的追打攻击。\n即使自身受到扎根、束缚、无法逃走或踩影、沙穴、磁力的影响，也可以替换宝可梦。\n若伏特替换使目标发动了携带的逃脱按键，则使用者不会退场。\n伏特替换使目标陷入濒死状态时，不影响使用者的替换。","levelUpMoves":[{"Name":"Shinx","Level":24},{"Name":"Luxio","Level":31},{"Name":"Luxray","Level":33},{"Name":"Emolga","Level":40},{"Name":"Thundurus form:incarnate","Level":35},{"Name":"Thundurus form:therian","Level":35},{"Name":"Helioptile","Level":24},{"Name":"Heliolisk","Level":0},{"Name":"Dedenne","Level":30},{"Name":"Zeraora","Level":32},{"Name":"Wattrel","Level":37},{"Name":"Kilowattrel","Level":43}],"tutorMoves":[],"eggMoves":[],"trMoves":[],"hmMoves":[],"transferMoves":["Raichu form:alolan"],"tmMoves9":["Raichu","Raichu form:alolan","Geodude form:alolan","Graveler form:alolan","Golem form:alolan","Magnemite","Magneton","Voltorb","Voltorb form:hisuian","Electrode","Electrode form:hisuian","Electabuzz","Jolteon","Zapdos","Mew","Chinchou","Lanturn","Mareep","Mareep form:shorn","Flaaffy","Ampharos","Forretress","Elekid","Raikou","Nosepass","Plusle","Minun","Shinx","Luxio","Luxray","Pachirisu","Magnezone","Electivire","Probopass","Blitzle","Zebstrika","Joltik","Galvantula","Eelektrik","Eelektross","Cobalion","Zekrom","Dedenne","Grubbin","Charjabug","Vikavolt","Regieleki","Pawmi","Pawmo","Pawmot","Tadbulb","Bellibolt","Wattrel","Kilowattrel","SandyShocks","IronTreads","IronHands","IronThorns","Miraidon"],"tmMoves8":["Pikachu","Pikachu form:belle","Pikachu form:cosplay","Pikachu form:phd","Pikachu form:popstar","Pikachu form:rockstar","Pikachu form:libre","Raichu","Raichu form:alolan","Magnemite","Magneton","Electabuzz","Jolteon","Zapdos","Mew","Chinchou","Lanturn","Pichu","Pichu form:spiky","Elekid","Raikou","Electrike","Manectric","Shinx","Luxio","Luxray","Magnezone","Electivire","Rotom","Rotom form:heat","Rotom form:wash","Rotom form:frost","Rotom form:fan","Rotom form:mow","Emolga","Joltik","Galvantula","Klink","Kl